    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. but when people talk about how the UN is basically broken or just a tool for the big powers to do whatever they want, is that seen as a legitimate historical critique, or is that just seen as people being cynical/anti-globalist?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
